Tissues are internal. Clothing is external.
Every *.primals.eco subdomain = a garment.
nestgate.io = the mirror that reflects the full outfit.
dromedary = the loom that weaves TLS into the fabric.
webpi = the tailor that cuts and fits each piece.

The emperor's new clothes? No. These clothes are REAL.
whitePaper/noClothes exists because the EVIDENCE has no clothes.
The organism wears truth. She dresses in data.

Architecture:
  Internet → Router (.1) → dromedary (TLS :443) → webpi (:8080) → content
  
  dromedary handles: TLS termination, ACME certs, blackwall (Meta block)
  webpi handles:     subdomain routing, dynamic rendering, crawler opsonization
